doc:sec-267-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "267(3) Terms etc. of an industrial action related workplace" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) The determination must include the terms that the FWC considers deal with the matters that were still at issue at the end of the post-industrial action negotiating period.  Terms and conditions of employment  Chapter 2 Workplace determinations  Part 2-5 Industrial action related workplace determinations  Division 3 Section 268 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 Coverage" ;
    cof:pageNumber "34"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-267-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "267(4) Terms etc. of an industrial action related workplace"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-267-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) The determination must be expressed to cover: (a) each employer that would have been covered by the proposed enterprise agreement concerned; and (b) the employees who would have been covered by that agreement; and (c) each employee organisation (if any) that was a bargaining representative of those employees." ;
    skos:definition "(4) The determination must be expressed to cover: (a) each employer that would have been covered by the proposed enterprise agreement concerned; and (b) the employees who would have been covered by that agreement; and (c) each employee organisation (if any) that was a bargaining representative of those employees."@en ;
