doc:sec-275 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "275 Factors the FWC must take into account in deciding terms of a" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "workplace determination The factors that the FWC must take into account in deciding which terms to include in a workplace determination include the following: (a) the merits of the case; (c) the interests of the employers and employees who will be covered by the determination; (ca) the significance, to those employers and employees, of any arrangements or benefits in an enterprise agreement that, immediately before the determination is made, applies to any of the employers in respect of any of the employees; (d) the public interest; (e) how productivity might be improved in the enterprise or enterprises concerned; (f) the extent to which the conduct of the bargaining representatives for the proposed enterprise agreement concerned was reasonable during bargaining for the agreement; (g) the extent to which the bargaining representatives for the proposed enterprise agreement concerned have complied with the good faith bargaining requirements; (h) incentives to continue to bargain at a later time.  Terms and conditions of employment  Chapter 2 Workplace determinations  Part 2-5 Operation, coverage and interaction etc. of workplace determinations  Division 6 Section 276 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
    cof:pageNumber "42"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-277 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "277 Employers, employees and employee organisations covered by a"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-277 ;
    values:originalText "workplace determination Employers, employees and employee organisations (1) A workplace determination covers an employer, employee or employee organisation if the determination is expressed to cover the employer, employee or organisation. Effect of provisions of this Act, FWC orders and court orders on coverage (2) A workplace determination also covers an employer, employee or employee organisation if any of the following provides, or has the  Chapter 2  Terms and conditions of employment" ;
