doc:sec-281-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "281(1) Applications by bargaining representatives" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) This section applies if a provision of this Part permits an application to be made by a bargaining representative of an employer that would have been covered by a proposed enterprise agreement. Persons who may make applications" ;
    cof:pageNumber "47"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-281-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "281(2) Applications by bargaining representatives"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-281-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) If the agreement would have covered more than one employer, the application may be made by: (a) in the case of a proposed enterprise agreement in relation to which a single interest employer authorisation is in operation—the person (if any) specified in the authorisation as the person who may make applications under this Act; or (b) in any case—a bargaining representative of an employer that would have been covered by the agreement, on behalf of one or more other such bargaining representatives, if those other bargaining representatives have agreed to the application being made on their behalf." ;
    skos:definition "(2) If the agreement would have covered more than one employer, the application may be made by: (a) in the case of a proposed enterprise agreement in relation to which a single interest employer authorisation is in operation—the person (if any) specified in the authorisation as the person who may make applications under this Act; or (b) in any case—a bargaining representative of an employer that would have been covered by the agreement, on behalf of one or more other such bargaining representatives, if those other bargaining representatives have agreed to the application being made on their behalf."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9787896d0427657211f156f4a9bad334bf305286d9e5c7f29196a02eaad4309e" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-281 ;
    cof:pageNumber "47"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Application for proposed enterprise agreement" ;
