concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-281a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "281A How employees, employers and employee organisations are to"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-281a ;
    values:originalText "be described (1) This section applies if a provision of this Part requires or permits an instrument of any kind to specify the employers, employees or employee organisations covered, or who will be covered, by a workplace determination or other instrument. (2) The employees may be specified by class or by name. (3) The employers and employee organisations must be specified by name. (4) Without limiting the way in which a class may be described for the purposes of subsection (2), the class may be described by reference to one or more of the following: (a) a particular industry or part of an industry; (b) a particular kind of work; (c) a particular type of employment; (d) a particular classification, job level or grade.  Terms and conditions of employment  Chapter 2 Minimum wages  Part 2-6 Introduction  Division 1 Section 282 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
    skos:definition "be described (1) This section applies if a provision of this Part requires or permits an instrument of any kind to specify the employers, employees or employee organisations covered, or who will be covered, by a workplace determination or other instrument. (2) The employees may be specified by class or by name. (3) The employers and employee organisations must be specified by name. (4) Without limiting the way in which a class may be described for the purposes of subsection (2), the class may be described by reference to one or more of the following: (a) a particular industry or part of an industry; (b) a particular kind of work; (c) a particular type of employment; (d) a particular classification, job level or grade.  Terms and conditions of employment  Chapter 2 Minimum wages  Part 2-6 Introduction  Division 1 Section 282 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "77dfd80a3f1e8f2e7a8f521433d129be7a52bb41e5c39ecf6207d92d4594b074" ;
    cof:pageNumber "48"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-281a-ss-1 ;
