concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-1 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "1 July, but only if:"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-1 ;
    values:originalText "(a) the FWC is satisfied that there are exceptional circumstances justifying the adjustment taking effect on that day; and (b) the adjustment is limited just to the particular situation to which the exceptional circumstances relate.  Chapter 2  Terms and conditions of employment" ;
    skos:definition "(a) the FWC is satisfied that there are exceptional circumstances justifying the adjustment taking effect on that day; and (b) the adjustment is limited just to the particular situation to which the exceptional circumstances relate.  Chapter 2  Terms and conditions of employment"@en ;
