concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-290 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "290 President may direct investigations and reports"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-290 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The President may give a direction under section 582 requiring that a matter be investigated, and that a report about the matter be prepared, for consideration in an annual wage review. (2) The direction: (a) may be given to: (i) an Expert Panel; or  Chapter 2  Terms and conditions of employment" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The President may give a direction under section 582 requiring that a matter be investigated, and that a report about the matter be prepared, for consideration in an annual wage review. (2) The direction: (a) may be given to: (i) an Expert Panel; or  Chapter 2  Terms and conditions of employment"@en ;
