concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-294-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "294(2) Content of national minimum wage order—main provisions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-294-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The order: (a) must require employers to pay employees to whom the national minimum wage applies a base rate of pay that at least equals the national minimum wage; and (b) must require employers to pay to employees to whom a special national minimum wage applies a base rate of pay that at least equals that special national minimum wage; and (c) must require employers to pay, to award/agreement free employees who are casual employees, a casual loading that at  Chapter 2  Terms and conditions of employment" ;
    skos:definition "(2) The order: (a) must require employers to pay employees to whom the national minimum wage applies a base rate of pay that at least equals the national minimum wage; and (b) must require employers to pay to employees to whom a special national minimum wage applies a base rate of pay that at least equals that special national minimum wage; and (c) must require employers to pay, to award/agreement free employees who are casual employees, a casual loading that at  Chapter 2  Terms and conditions of employment"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "86af7ea3e400a1a9aa85d5feba74ef5a2b7da19a86778a388eebfb87de2a1230" ;
