    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) This section applies if a determination varying a national minimum wage order has a retrospective effect because it comes into operation under subsection 297(2) on a day before the day on which the determination is made. No creation of liability to pay pecuniary penalty for past conduct" ;
