concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-301 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "301 Meanings of employee and employer"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-301 ;
    values:originalText "In this Part, employee means a national system employee, and employer means a national system employer. Note: See also Division 2 of Part 6-4A (TCF contract outworkers taken to be employees in certain circumstances).  Terms and conditions of employment  Chapter 2 Equal remuneration  Part 2-7 Equal remuneration orders  Division 2 Section 302 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
