concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-306ea a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "306EA Regulated labour hire arrangement order may cover"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-306ea ;
    values:originalText "additional arrangements Determination that application covers additional employers and employees (1) If an application for a regulated labour hire arrangement order is made in relation to a regulated host, an employer and one or more employees of the employer, the FWC may determine that the application is taken to also relate to: (a) one or more other employers (each of which is an additional employer) that the FWC is satisfied supply or will supply, in the manner referred to in paragraph 306E(1)(a), one or more employees to perform work, for the regulated host, of the kind in relation to which the application was made; and (b) the employees referred to in paragraph (a) of this subsection (each of whom is an additional regulated employee).  Chapter 2  Terms and conditions of employment" ;
    skos:definition "additional arrangements Determination that application covers additional employers and employees (1) If an application for a regulated labour hire arrangement order is made in relation to a regulated host, an employer and one or more employees of the employer, the FWC may determine that the application is taken to also relate to: (a) one or more other employers (each of which is an additional employer) that the FWC is satisfied supply or will supply, in the manner referred to in paragraph 306E(1)(a), one or more employees to perform work, for the regulated host, of the kind in relation to which the application was made; and (b) the employees referred to in paragraph (a) of this subsection (each of whom is an additional regulated employee).  Chapter 2  Terms and conditions of employment"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6004e5cc4470dff07ff9d5a2fe444da72d161abf252d1a923a30a412c8dd4ca8" ;
    cof:pageNumber "75"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Determination that application covers additional employers and employees" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <fair-work-act-2009.pdf> ;
    dc:source "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.75" ;
    cml:asserts concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-306ea-norm .
