concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-306l a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "306L Making and effect of determinations under this Subdivision"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-306l ;
    values:originalText "Who may apply for determination (1) The FWC may make a determination under this Subdivision only on application by: (a) the regulated host, an employer covered by the regulated labour hire arrangement order or a regulated employee covered by the order who is performing or is to perform work for the regulated host; or (b) an organisation entitled to represent the industrial interests of any of those persons. Time for making determination (2) The FWC must decide whether or not to make the determination as quickly as possible after the application is made.  Chapter 2  Terms and conditions of employment" ;
    skos:definition "Who may apply for determination (1) The FWC may make a determination under this Subdivision only on application by: (a) the regulated host, an employer covered by the regulated labour hire arrangement order or a regulated employee covered by the order who is performing or is to perform work for the regulated host; or (b) an organisation entitled to represent the industrial interests of any of those persons. Time for making determination (2) The FWC must decide whether or not to make the determination as quickly as possible after the application is made.  Chapter 2  Terms and conditions of employment"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f5c8c3cfcc1da1467d1fb30731e9b119400cbde2f620bd727e1c2b0f955c0cc6" ;
    cof:pageNumber "89"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-306l-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-306l-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <fair-work-act-2009.pdf> ;
    dc:source "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.89" .
doc:sec-306l a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "306L Making and effect of determinations under this Subdivision" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "Who may apply for determination (1) The FWC may make a determination under this Subdivision only on application by: (a) the regulated host, an employer covered by the regulated labour hire arrangement order or a regulated employee covered by the order who is performing or is to perform work for the regulated host; or (b) an organisation entitled to represent the industrial interests of any of those persons. Time for making determination (2) The FWC must decide whether or not to make the determination as quickly as possible after the application is made.  Chapter 2  Terms and conditions of employment" ;
    cof:pageNumber "89"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-306l-ss-1 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "306L(1) Making and effect of determinations under this Subdivision"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-306l-ss-1 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The FWC may make a determination under this Subdivision only on application by: (a) the regulated host, an employer covered by the regulated labour hire arrangement order or a regulated employee covered by the order who is performing or is to perform work for the regulated host; or (b) an organisation entitled to represent the industrial interests of any of those persons. Time for making determination" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The FWC may make a determination under this Subdivision only on application by: (a) the regulated host, an employer covered by the regulated labour hire arrangement order or a regulated employee covered by the order who is performing or is to perform work for the regulated host; or (b) an organisation entitled to represent the industrial interests of any of those persons. Time for making determination"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "fb027c003d15b26af53e2650738bfe9f49ede882fd1b47f21bd8ea125c188134" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-306l ;
    cof:pageNumber "89"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Determination under this Subdivision must be made on application by regulated host, employer or organisation." ;
