concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-306r a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "306R Application fees"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-306r ;
    values:originalText "(1) An application under subsection 306P(4) must be accompanied by any fee prescribed by the regulations. (2) The regulations may prescribe: (a) a fee for making an application to the FWC under that subsection; and (b) a method for indexing the fee; and (c) the circumstances in which all or part of the fee may be waived or refunded.  Chapter 2  Terms and conditions of employment" ;
    skos:definition "(1) An application under subsection 306P(4) must be accompanied by any fee prescribed by the regulations. (2) The regulations may prescribe: (a) a fee for making an application to the FWC under that subsection; and (b) a method for indexing the fee; and (c) the circumstances in which all or part of the fee may be waived or refunded.  Chapter 2  Terms and conditions of employment"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ee11f664ff6baebe4eeb09e4b14be07865517b6b9d2b431b9158d399de8232bd" ;
    cof:pageNumber "101"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-306r-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-306r-ss-2 ;
