doc:sec-315-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "315(1) Organisations covered by transferable instrument" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) If: (a) a named employer award covers the new employer because of paragraph 313(1)(a); and (b) the named employer award covered an employer organisation in relation to the old employer immediately before the termination of a transferring employee’s employment with the old employer; then the named employer award covers the employer organisation in relation to the new employer. Employee organisation covered by named employer award" ;
