doc:sec-316-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "316(1) Transferring employees who are high income employees" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) This section applies if: (a) the old employer had given a guarantee of annual earnings for a guaranteed period to a transferring employee; and (b) the transferring employee was a high income employee immediately before the termination of the transferring employee’s employment with the old employer; and (c) some of the guaranteed period occurs after the time (the transfer time) the transferring employee becomes employed by the new employer; and (d) an enterprise agreement does not apply to the transferring employee in relation to the transferring work at the transfer time." ;
    cof:pageNumber "114"^^xsd:integer .

