doc:sec-316-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "316(4) Transferring employees who are high income employees" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) The new employer is not required to comply with the guarantee of annual earnings to the extent that it requires the new employer to pay an amount of earnings to the transferring employee, in relation to the part of the guaranteed period after the transfer time, at a rate that is more than the annual rate of the guarantee of annual earnings.  Terms and conditions of employment  Chapter 2 Transfer of business  Part 2-8 Transfer of instruments  Division 2 Section 316 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
