    values:originalText "(3) Despite paragraph (1)(b), if a modern award or an enterprise agreement specifies a particular method by which the money must be paid, then the employer must pay the money by that method. Note: This subsection is a civil remedy provision (see Part 4-1).  Terms and conditions of employment  Chapter 2 Other terms and conditions of employment  Part 2-9 Payment of wages etc.  Division 2 Section 324 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(3) Despite paragraph (1)(b), if a modern award or an enterprise agreement specifies a particular method by which the money must be paid, then the employer must pay the money by that method. Note: This subsection is a civil remedy provision (see Part 4-1).  Terms and conditions of employment  Chapter 2 Other terms and conditions of employment  Part 2-9 Payment of wages etc.  Division 2 Section 324 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026"@en ;
