doc:sec-325-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "325(2) Unreasonable requirements to spend or pay amount" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The regulations may prescribe circumstances in which a requirement referred to in subsection (1) or (1A) is or is not reasonable.  Terms and conditions of employment  Chapter 2 Other terms and conditions of employment  Part 2-9 Payment of wages etc.  Division 2 Section 326 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
