concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-327c a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "327C Commencing proceedings for certain offences against this Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-327c ;
    values:originalText "(1) Proceedings for an offence against: (a) subsection 327A(1) (offence for failing to pay amounts as required); or (b) a related offence provision, to the extent that the related offence provision relates to an offence against subsection 327A(1); may be commenced only by the Director of Public Prosecutions or the Australian Federal Police. (2) Despite anything in any other law, proceedings for an offence against a provision referred to in paragraph (1)(a) or (b) may be commenced at any time within 6 years after the commission of the offence.  Terms and conditions of employment  Chapter 2 Other terms and conditions of employment  Part 2-9 Guarantee of annual earnings  Division 3 Section 328 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(1) Proceedings for an offence against: (a) subsection 327A(1) (offence for failing to pay amounts as required); or (b) a related offence provision, to the extent that the related offence provision relates to an offence against subsection 327A(1); may be commenced only by the Director of Public Prosecutions or the Australian Federal Police. (2) Despite anything in any other law, proceedings for an offence against a provision referred to in paragraph (1)(a) or (b) may be commenced at any time within 6 years after the commission of the offence.  Terms and conditions of employment  Chapter 2 Other terms and conditions of employment  Part 2-9 Guarantee of annual earnings  Division 3 Section 328 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "828beb2648ca21cd59f59f5fb42c50a060e202e6284f17d3e0894ffb5df3c884" ;
    cof:pageNumber "132"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-327c-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-327c-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <fair-work-act-2009.pdf> ;
