concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-332-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "332(2) Earnings"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-332-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) However, an employee’s earnings do not include the following: (a) payments the amount of which cannot be determined in advance; (b) reimbursements; (c) contributions to a superannuation fund to the extent that they are contributions to which subsection (4) applies; (d) amounts prescribed by the regulations. Note: Some examples of payments covered by paragraph (a) are commissions, incentive-based payments and bonuses, and overtime (unless the overtime is guaranteed)." ;
    skos:definition "(2) However, an employee’s earnings do not include the following: (a) payments the amount of which cannot be determined in advance; (b) reimbursements; (c) contributions to a superannuation fund to the extent that they are contributions to which subsection (4) applies; (d) amounts prescribed by the regulations. Note: Some examples of payments covered by paragraph (a) are commissions, incentive-based payments and bonuses, and overtime (unless the overtime is guaranteed)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "1a6f2599f6bd38ef8546bbc3744a848d437549e07362b35d42df518555a418e5" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-332 ;
    cof:pageNumber "136"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Employee earnings do not include certain payments and reimbursements." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
