doc:sec-332-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "332(2) Earnings" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) However, an employee’s earnings do not include the following: (a) payments the amount of which cannot be determined in advance; (b) reimbursements; (c) contributions to a superannuation fund to the extent that they are contributions to which subsection (4) applies; (d) amounts prescribed by the regulations. Note: Some examples of payments covered by paragraph (a) are commissions, incentive-based payments and bonuses, and overtime (unless the overtime is guaranteed)." ;
    cof:pageNumber "136"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-332-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "332(3) Earnings"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-332-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) Non-monetary benefits are benefits other than an entitlement to a payment of money: (a) to which the employee is entitled in return for the performance of work; and  Terms and conditions of employment  Chapter 2 Other terms and conditions of employment  Part 2-9 Guarantee of annual earnings  Division 3 Section 333 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 (b) for which a reasonable money value has been agreed by the employee and the employer; but does not include a benefit prescribed by the regulations." ;
    skos:definition "(3) Non-monetary benefits are benefits other than an entitlement to a payment of money: (a) to which the employee is entitled in return for the performance of work; and  Terms and conditions of employment  Chapter 2 Other terms and conditions of employment  Part 2-9 Guarantee of annual earnings  Division 3 Section 333 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 (b) for which a reasonable money value has been agreed by the employee and the employer; but does not include a benefit prescribed by the regulations."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "dbde35bbb9cb512b8104fafea21ac16aaab0103194c7cfbdd2c249a465f3f066" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-332 ;
    cof:pageNumber "136"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Employee entitlement to non-monetary benefits" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
