doc:sec-332-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "332(3) Earnings" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) Non-monetary benefits are benefits other than an entitlement to a payment of money: (a) to which the employee is entitled in return for the performance of work; and  Terms and conditions of employment  Chapter 2 Other terms and conditions of employment  Part 2-9 Guarantee of annual earnings  Division 3 Section 333 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 (b) for which a reasonable money value has been agreed by the employee and the employer; but does not include a benefit prescribed by the regulations." ;
