doc:sec-333-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "333(3) High income threshold" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) If: (a) in prescribing a manner in which the high income threshold is worked out, regulations made for the purposes of subsection (1) specify a particular matter or state of affairs; and (b) as a result of a change in the matter or state of affairs, the amount of the high income threshold worked out in that manner would, but for this subsection, be less than it was on the last occasion on which this subsection did not apply;  Chapter 2  Terms and conditions of employment" ;
    cof:pageNumber "137"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-333a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "333A Prospective employees"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-333a ;
    values:originalText "If: (a) an employer, or a person who may become an employer, gives to another person an undertaking that would have been a guarantee of annual earnings if the other person had been the employer’s or person’s employee; and (b) the other person subsequently becomes the employer’s or person’s employee; and (c) the undertaking relates to the work that the other person performs for the employer or person; this Division applies in relation to the undertaking, after the other person becomes the employer’s or person’s employee, as if the other person had been the employer’s or person’s employee at the time the undertaking was given.  Terms and conditions of employment  Chapter 2 Other terms and conditions of employment  Part 2-9 Prohibiting pay secrecy  Division 4 Section 333B Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
    skos:definition "If: (a) an employer, or a person who may become an employer, gives to another person an undertaking that would have been a guarantee of annual earnings if the other person had been the employer’s or person’s employee; and (b) the other person subsequently becomes the employer’s or person’s employee; and (c) the undertaking relates to the work that the other person performs for the employer or person; this Division applies in relation to the undertaking, after the other person becomes the employer’s or person’s employee, as if the other person had been the employer’s or person’s employee at the time the undertaking was given.  Terms and conditions of employment  Chapter 2 Other terms and conditions of employment  Part 2-9 Prohibiting pay secrecy  Division 4 Section 333B Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "bccb8f93be7ac5a3e4a01de509f2086e0e53b71d8dfa49191d795cfba3ba6ea9" ;
    cof:pageNumber "138"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Employer's guarantee of annual earnings obligation" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <fair-work-act-2009.pdf> ;
    dc:source "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.138" ;
    cml:asserts concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-333a-norm .
