doc:sec-333u a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "333U Declarations by the Director-General of ASIS" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1) Without limiting section 333S, the Director-General of the Australian Secret Intelligence Service may, by legislative instrument, declare that all or specified provisions of this Subdivision do not apply in relation to a person carrying out work for the Director-General. (2) A declaration under subsection (1) may only be made with the approval of the Minister and, if made with that approval, has effect according to its terms. Subdivision D—Dealing with disputes in other ways" ;
    cof:pageNumber "154"^^xsd:integer .

