    skos:prefLabel "333W Guidelines"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-333w ;
    values:originalText "(1) The FWC must make written guidelines in relation to the operation of this Division. (2) Guidelines made under subsection (1) are not a legislative instrument.  Terms and conditions of employment  Chapter 2 Other terms and conditions of employment  Part 2-9 Preservation of employer-funded paid parental leave  Division 7 Section 333X Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
