    skos:prefLabel "338(1) Action to which this Part applies"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-338-ss-1 ;
    values:originalText "(1) This Part applies to the following action: (a) action taken by a constitutionally-covered entity; (b) action that affects, is capable of affecting or is taken with intent to affect the activities, functions, relationships or business of a constitutionally-covered entity; (c) action that consists of advising, encouraging or inciting, or action taken with intent to coerce, a constitutionally-covered entity: (i) to take, or not take, particular action in relation to another person; or (ii) to threaten to take, or not take, particular action in relation to another person; (d) action taken in a Territory or a Commonwealth place; (e) action taken by: (i) a trade and commerce employer; or (ii) a Territory employer; that affects, is capable of affecting or is taken with intent to affect an employee of the employer; (f) action taken by an employee of: (i) a trade and commerce employer; or (ii) a Territory employer; that affects, is capable of affecting or is taken with intent to affect the employee’s employer." ;
    skos:definition "(1) This Part applies to the following action: (a) action taken by a constitutionally-covered entity; (b) action that affects, is capable of affecting or is taken with intent to affect the activities, functions, relationships or business of a constitutionally-covered entity; (c) action that consists of advising, encouraging or inciting, or action taken with intent to coerce, a constitutionally-covered entity: (i) to take, or not take, particular action in relation to another person; or (ii) to threaten to take, or not take, particular action in relation to another person; (d) action taken in a Territory or a Commonwealth place; (e) action taken by: (i) a trade and commerce employer; or (ii) a Territory employer; that affects, is capable of affecting or is taken with intent to affect an employee of the employer; (f) action taken by an employee of: (i) a trade and commerce employer; or (ii) a Territory employer; that affects, is capable of affecting or is taken with intent to affect the employee’s employer."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ee0b405204fbd574c9e4ff4ed9b8a31e7d353b68865141a91f426b4a051af64c" ;
