concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-338a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "338A Meaning of independent contractor"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-338a ;
    values:originalText "A reference in this Part to an independent contractor includes a reference to a regulated worker. Note: A regulated worker must be an individual: see section 15G and related definitions." ;
    skos:definition "A reference in this Part to an independent contractor includes a reference to a regulated worker. Note: A regulated worker must be an individual: see section 15G and related definitions."@en ;
