concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-339 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "339 Additional effect of this Part"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-339 ;
    values:originalText "In addition to the effect provided by section 338, this Part also has the effect it would have if any one or more of the following applied: (a) a reference to an employer in one or more provisions of this Part were a reference to a national system employer; (b) a reference to an employee in one or more provisions of this Part were a reference to a national system employee; (c) a reference to an industrial association in one or more provisions of this Part were a reference to an organisation, or another association of employees or employers, a purpose of which is the protection and promotion of the interests of national system employees or national system employers in matters concerning employment; (d) a reference to an officer of an industrial association in one or more provisions of this Part were a reference to an officer of an organisation;  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc.  Chapter 3 General protections  Part 3-1 Application of this Part  Division 2 Section 339 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 (e) a reference to a person, another person or a third person in one or more provisions of this Part were a reference to a constitutionally-covered entity; (f) a reference to a workplace law in one or more provisions of this Part were a reference to a workplace law of the Commonwealth; (g) a reference to a workplace instrument in one or more provisions of this Part were a reference to a workplace instrument made under, or recognised by, a law of the Commonwealth; (h) a reference to an industrial body in one or more provisions of this Part were a reference to an industrial body performing functions or exercising powers under a law of the Commonwealth.  Chapter 3  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc." ;
    skos:definition "In addition to the effect provided by section 338, this Part also has the effect it would have if any one or more of the following applied: (a) a reference to an employer in one or more provisions of this Part were a reference to a national system employer; (b) a reference to an employee in one or more provisions of this Part were a reference to a national system employee; (c) a reference to an industrial association in one or more provisions of this Part were a reference to an organisation, or another association of employees or employers, a purpose of which is the protection and promotion of the interests of national system employees or national system employers in matters concerning employment; (d) a reference to an officer of an industrial association in one or more provisions of this Part were a reference to an officer of an organisation;  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc.  Chapter 3 General protections  Part 3-1 Application of this Part  Division 2 Section 339 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 (e) a reference to a person, another person or a third person in one or more provisions of this Part were a reference to a constitutionally-covered entity; (f) a reference to a workplace law in one or more provisions of this Part were a reference to a workplace law of the Commonwealth; (g) a reference to a workplace instrument in one or more provisions of this Part were a reference to a workplace instrument made under, or recognised by, a law of the Commonwealth; (h) a reference to an industrial body in one or more provisions of this Part were a reference to an industrial body performing functions or exercising powers under a law of the Commonwealth.  Chapter 3  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "2fec0a462790c8a0dea00f885354bb4e82512fab2c6c282fbac34848fcac143b" ;
    cof:pageNumber "160"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Additional effect of this Part also has the effect it would have if any one or more of the following applied." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
