concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-348 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "348 Coercion"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-348 ;
    values:originalText "A person must not organise or take, or threaten to organise or take, any action against another person with intent to coerce the other person, or a third person, to engage in industrial activity. Note: This section is a civil remedy provision (see Part 4-1)." ;
    skos:definition "A person must not organise or take, or threaten to organise or take, any action against another person with intent to coerce the other person, or a third person, to engage in industrial activity. Note: This section is a civil remedy provision (see Part 4-1)."@en ;
