concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-350-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "350(3) Inducements—membership action"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-350-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) A person takes membership action if the person becomes, does not become, remains or ceases to be, an officer or member of an industrial association." ;
    skos:definition "(3) A person takes membership action if the person becomes, does not become, remains or ceases to be, an officer or member of an industrial association."@en ;
