concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-350c-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "350C(5) Workplace delegates and their rights"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-350c-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) Otherwise, in determining what is reasonable for the purposes of subsection (3), regard must be had to the following: (a) the size and nature of the enterprise or regulated business; (b) the resources of the employer concerned or the regulated business; (c) the facilities available at the enterprise or provided by the regulated business.  Chapter 3  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc." ;
    skos:definition "(5) Otherwise, in determining what is reasonable for the purposes of subsection (3), regard must be had to the following: (a) the size and nature of the enterprise or regulated business; (b) the resources of the employer concerned or the regulated business; (c) the facilities available at the enterprise or provided by the regulated business.  Chapter 3  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "1cbcb1b534d7048fc4585c42976fb8a65949b9770c1b4d41b586a94515d18795" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-350c ;
    cof:pageNumber "174"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Employer must consider size and nature of enterprise, resources, and facilities when determining what is reasonable for purposes of subsection (3)." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <fair-work-act-2009.pdf> ;
    dc:source "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.174" ;
