concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-354-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "354(3) Coverage by particular instruments"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-354-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) A person must not discriminate against a regulated business because: (a) regulated workers in relation to the regulated business are covered, or not covered, by a particular type of workplace instrument (including a particular kind of workplace instrument within a type of workplace instrument); or (b) it is proposed that regulated workers in relation to the regulated business are covered, or not covered, by a  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc.  Chapter 3 General protections  Part 3-1 Other protections  Division 5 Section 355 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 particular type of workplace instrument (including a particular kind of workplace instrument within a type of workplace instrument). Note: This subsection is a civil remedy provision (see Part 4-1)." ;
