concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-356 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "356 Objectionable terms"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-356 ;
    values:originalText "A term of a workplace instrument, or an agreement or arrangement (whether written or unwritten), has no effect to the extent that it is an objectionable term.  Chapter 3  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc." ;
    skos:definition "A term of a workplace instrument, or an agreement or arrangement (whether written or unwritten), has no effect to the extent that it is an objectionable term.  Chapter 3  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc."@en ;
