    skos:scopeNote "borne by: State" ;
    values:deonticStatus values:HeuristicDerived ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed .
doc:sec-365 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "365 Application for the FWC to deal with a dismissal dispute" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "If: (a) a person has been dismissed; and (b) the person, or an industrial association that is entitled to represent the industrial interests of the person, alleges that the person was dismissed in contravention of this Part; the person, or the industrial association, may apply to the FWC for the FWC to deal with the dispute." ;
    cof:pageNumber "185"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-366 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "366 Time for application"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-366 ;
    values:originalText "(1) An application under section 365 must be made: (a) within 21 days after the dismissal took effect; or (b) within such further period as the FWC allows under subsection (2). (2) The FWC may allow a further period if the FWC is satisfied that there are exceptional circumstances, taking into account: (a) the reason for the delay; and (b) any action taken by the person to dispute the dismissal; and (c) prejudice to the employer (including prejudice caused by the delay); and (d) the merits of the application; and (e) fairness as between the person and other persons in a like position." ;
    skos:definition "(1) An application under section 365 must be made: (a) within 21 days after the dismissal took effect; or (b) within such further period as the FWC allows under subsection (2). (2) The FWC may allow a further period if the FWC is satisfied that there are exceptional circumstances, taking into account: (a) the reason for the delay; and (b) any action taken by the person to dispute the dismissal; and (c) prejudice to the employer (including prejudice caused by the delay); and (d) the merits of the application; and (e) fairness as between the person and other persons in a like position."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d08394e8bc5d93827c9f28c40cddb9ae1c62891df6f1b036479f4767fc5dda61" ;
    cof:pageNumber "185"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-366-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-366-ss-2 ;
