doc:sec-368-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "368(3) Dealing with a dismissal dispute (other than by arbitration)" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) If the FWC is satisfied that all reasonable attempts to resolve the dispute (other than by arbitration) have been, or are likely to be, unsuccessful, then: (a) the FWC must issue a certificate to that effect; and (b) if the FWC considers, taking into account all the materials before it, that arbitration under section 369, or a general protections court application, in relation to the dispute would not have a reasonable prospect of success, the FWC must advise the parties accordingly." ;
    cof:pageNumber "186"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-368-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "368(4) Dealing with a dismissal dispute (other than by arbitration)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-368-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) A general protections court application is an application to a court under Division 2 of Part 4-1 for orders in relation to a contravention of this Part.  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc.  Chapter 3 General protections  Part 3-1 Compliance  Division 8 Section 369 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(4) A general protections court application is an application to a court under Division 2 of Part 4-1 for orders in relation to a contravention of this Part.  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc.  Chapter 3 General protections  Part 3-1 Compliance  Division 8 Section 369 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c2b4e45d50a8f5596891a3edbe52b5546745e5b3c2b3b20f60129182146f9d5b" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-368 ;
    cof:pageNumber "186"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Application for orders in relation to a contravention of this Part." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
