concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-373 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "373 Application fees"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-373 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The application must be accompanied by any fee prescribed by the regulations. (2) The regulations may prescribe: (a) a fee for making an application to the FWC under section 372; and (b) a method for indexing the fee; and (c) the circumstances in which all or part of the fee may be waived or refunded." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The application must be accompanied by any fee prescribed by the regulations. (2) The regulations may prescribe: (a) a fee for making an application to the FWC under section 372; and (b) a method for indexing the fee; and (c) the circumstances in which all or part of the fee may be waived or refunded."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d5f581474253f35a642d632cd9b90b26569c9cdb0b1620cdaeb796531baec7bd" ;
    cof:pageNumber "189"^^xsd:integer ;
