concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-377a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "377A Schedule of costs"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-377a ;
    values:originalText "(1) A schedule of costs may be prescribed in relation to items of expenditure likely to be incurred in relation to matters that can be covered by an order under section 611, 375B or 376 in relation to an application under section 365, including expenses arising from the representation of a party by a person or organisation other than on a legal professional basis.  Chapter 3  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A schedule of costs may be prescribed in relation to items of expenditure likely to be incurred in relation to matters that can be covered by an order under section 611, 375B or 376 in relation to an application under section 365, including expenses arising from the representation of a party by a person or organisation other than on a legal professional basis.  Chapter 3  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc."@en ;
