    values:originalText "A person to whom an order for costs made under section 375B or 376 applies must not contravene a term of the order. Note: This section is a civil remedy provision (see Part 4-1).  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc.  Chapter 3 Unfair dismissal  Part 3-2 Introduction  Division 1 Section 379 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
