concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-380 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "380 Meanings of employee and employer"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-380 ;
    values:originalText "In this Part, employee means a national system employee, and employer means a national system employer. Note: See also Division 2 of Part 6-4A (TCF contract outworkers taken to be employees in certain circumstances)." ;
    skos:definition "In this Part, employee means a national system employee, and employer means a national system employer. Note: See also Division 2 of Part 6-4A (TCF contract outworkers taken to be employees in certain circumstances)."@en ;
