concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-381 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "381 Object of this Part"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-381 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The object of this Part is: (a) to establish a framework for dealing with unfair dismissal that balances: (i) the needs of business (including small business); and (ii) the needs of employees; and (b) to establish procedures for dealing with unfair dismissal that:  Chapter 3  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The object of this Part is: (a) to establish a framework for dealing with unfair dismissal that balances: (i) the needs of business (including small business); and (ii) the needs of employees; and (b) to establish procedures for dealing with unfair dismissal that:  Chapter 3  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc."@en ;
