concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-384 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "384 Period of employment"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-384 ;
    values:originalText "(1) An employee’s period of employment with an employer at a particular time is the period of continuous service the employee has completed with the employer at that time as an employee. (2) However:  Chapter 3  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc." ;
    skos:definition "(1) An employee’s period of employment with an employer at a particular time is the period of continuous service the employee has completed with the employer at that time as an employee. (2) However:  Chapter 3  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc."@en ;
