concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-388 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "388 The Small Business Fair Dismissal Code"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-388 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare a Small Business Fair Dismissal Code. (2) A person’s dismissal was consistent with the Small Business Fair Dismissal Code if: (a) immediately before the time of the dismissal or at the time the person was given notice of the dismissal (whichever happened first), the person’s employer was a small business employer; and (b) the employer complied with the Small Business Fair Dismissal Code in relation to the dismissal." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare a Small Business Fair Dismissal Code. (2) A person’s dismissal was consistent with the Small Business Fair Dismissal Code if: (a) immediately before the time of the dismissal or at the time the person was given notice of the dismissal (whichever happened first), the person’s employer was a small business employer; and (b) the employer complied with the Small Business Fair Dismissal Code in relation to the dismissal."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d8a85253d4a9cc89b707378728c132cc24358258714ebd4455ffa21399924fb1" ;
    cof:pageNumber "199"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-388-ss-1 ;
