concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-394 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "394 Application for unfair dismissal remedy"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-394 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A person who has been dismissed may apply to the FWC for an order under Division 4 granting a remedy. Note 1: Division 4 sets out when the FWC may order a remedy for unfair dismissal. Note 2: For application fees, see section 395. Note 3:" ;
    skos:definition "(1) A person who has been dismissed may apply to the FWC for an order under Division 4 granting a remedy. Note 1: Division 4 sets out when the FWC may order a remedy for unfair dismissal. Note 2: For application fees, see section 395. Note 3:"@en ;
