concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-395 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "395 Application fees"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-395 ;
    values:originalText "(1) An application to the FWC under this Division must be accompanied by any fee prescribed by the regulations.  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc.  Chapter 3 Unfair dismissal  Part 3-2 Procedural matters  Division 5 Section 396 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 (2) The regulations may prescribe: (a) a fee for making an application to the FWC under this Division; and (b) a method for indexing the fee; and (c) the circumstances in which all or part of the fee may be waived or refunded." ;
    skos:definition "(1) An application to the FWC under this Division must be accompanied by any fee prescribed by the regulations.  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc.  Chapter 3 Unfair dismissal  Part 3-2 Procedural matters  Division 5 Section 396 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 (2) The regulations may prescribe: (a) a fee for making an application to the FWC under this Division; and (b) a method for indexing the fee; and (c) the circumstances in which all or part of the fee may be waived or refunded."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "bcaabcf8a78fb79f925c7be77c9612425d16ba7182211ce0f0a6141ad0801c33" ;
    cof:pageNumber "204"^^xsd:integer ;
