concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-402 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "402 Applications for costs orders"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-402 ;
    values:originalText "An application for an order for costs under section 611 in relation to a matter arising under this Part, or for costs under section 400A or 401, must be made within 14 days after: (a) the FWC determines the matter; or (b) the matter is discontinued." ;
    skos:definition "An application for an order for costs under section 611 in relation to a matter arising under this Part, or for costs under section 400A or 401, must be made within 14 days after: (a) the FWC determines the matter; or (b) the matter is discontinued."@en ;
