 in relation to the industrial action, the notice requirements of section 430 must be met. (6A) Each bargaining representative who applied for a protected action ballot order for the protected action ballot for the industrial action must not have contravened any order made under section 448A (which is about mediation and conciliation conferences) that related to the protected action ballot order. Officer of an employee organisation (7) If an employee organisation is a bargaining representative of an employee who will be covered by the agreement, the reference to a  Chapter 3  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc." ;
