    skos:prefLabel "412 Pattern bargaining"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-412 ;
    values:originalText "Pattern bargaining (1) A course of conduct by a person is pattern bargaining if: (a) the person is a bargaining representative for 2 or more proposed enterprise agreements; and  Chapter 3  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc." ;
