doc:sec-414-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "414(4) Notice requirements for industrial action" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) Before a person engages in employee response action for a proposed enterprise agreement, a bargaining representative of an employee who will be covered by the agreement must give written notice of the action to the employer of the employee. Notice requirements—employer response action" ;
