    skos:prefLabel "414(6) Notice requirements for industrial action"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-414-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) A notice given under this section must specify the nature of the action and the day on which it will start.  Chapter 3  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc." ;
