concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-417-ss-2a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "417(2A) Industrial action must not be organised or engaged in before"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-417-ss-2a ;
    values:originalText "(2A) If the person is an employer or employee covered by an enterprise agreement because of a variation approved or made by the FWC under section 216AB, 216BA, 216CB or 216DC, the reference in paragraph (1)(a) to the day the enterprise agreement is approved by the FWC is taken to be a reference to the day the variation starts to operate in accordance with section 216AF, 216BC, 216CE or 216DF (as the case may be).  Chapter 3  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc." ;
    skos:definition "(2A) If the person is an employer or employee covered by an enterprise agreement because of a variation approved or made by the FWC under section 216AB, 216BA, 216CB or 216DC, the reference in paragraph (1)(a) to the day the enterprise agreement is approved by the FWC is taken to be a reference to the day the variation starts to operate in accordance with section 216AF, 216BC, 216CE or 216DF (as the case may be).  Chapter 3  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "30603f610d1e33f2fe64e6adb2ed2c27a6d0600b16918edbec60bce29c7a5435" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-417 ;
    cof:pageNumber "221"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Industrial action must not be organised or engaged in before a variation starts to operate." ;
