doc:sec-423-ss-6 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "423(6) FWC may suspend or terminate protected industrial action—" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(6) The FWC must be satisfied that: (a) the protected industrial action has been engaged in for a protracted period of time; and (b) the dispute will not be resolved in the reasonably foreseeable future. Order may be made on own initiative or on application" ;
    cof:pageNumber "228"^^xsd:integer .

