doc:sec-423-ss-7 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "423(7) FWC may suspend or terminate protected industrial action—" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(7) The FWC may make the order: (a) on its own initiative; or (b) on application by any of the following: (i) a bargaining representative for the agreement;  Chapter 3  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc." ;
