concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-427 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "427 FWC must specify the period of suspension"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-427 ;
    values:originalText "Application of this section (1) This section applies if the FWC is required or permitted by this Division to make an order suspending protected industrial action. Suspension period (2) The FWC must specify, in the order, the period for which the protected industrial action is suspended.  Chapter 3  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc." ;
    skos:definition "Application of this section (1) This section applies if the FWC is required or permitted by this Division to make an order suspending protected industrial action. Suspension period (2) The FWC must specify, in the order, the period for which the protected industrial action is suspended.  Chapter 3  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc."@en ;
