    skos:definition "(3) However, except as provided by regulations made for the purposes of subsection 466(1), the Commonwealth is not liable for any costs incurred by the Australian Electoral Commission in relation to  Chapter 3  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc."@en ;
