concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-466 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "466 Costs of legal challenges"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-466 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The regulations may provide for who is liable for costs incurred in relation to legal challenges to matters connected with a protected action ballot. (2) Regulations made for the purposes of subsection (1) may also provide for a person who is liable for costs referred to in that  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc.  Chapter 3 Industrial action  Part 3-3 Protected action ballots  Division 8 Section 467 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 subsection to be indemnified by another person for some or all of those costs. Subdivision G—Miscellaneous" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The regulations may provide for who is liable for costs incurred in relation to legal challenges to matters connected with a protected action ballot. (2) Regulations made for the purposes of subsection (1) may also provide for a person who is liable for costs referred to in that  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc.  Chapter 3 Industrial action  Part 3-3 Protected action ballots  Division 8 Section 467 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 subsection to be indemnified by another person for some or all of those costs. Subdivision G—Miscellaneous"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e76e74c371f97dfad5530ff88c4e9ead3483a5a9a7cd36756129123d8ab97ef9" ;
    cof:pageNumber "262"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-466-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-466-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <fair-work-act-2009.pdf> ;
    dc:source "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.262" .
