    values:originalText "(1) The regulations may provide for who is liable for costs incurred in relation to legal challenges to matters connected with a protected action ballot. (2) Regulations made for the purposes of subsection (1) may also provide for a person who is liable for costs referred to in that  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc.  Chapter 3 Industrial action  Part 3-3 Protected action ballots  Division 8 Section 467 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 subsection to be indemnified by another person for some or all of those costs. Subdivision G—Miscellaneous" ;
    cof:pageNumber "262"^^xsd:integer .

