concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-472 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "472 Orders by the FWC relating to certain partial work bans"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-472 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The FWC may make an order varying the proportion by which an employee’s payments are reduced. (2) The FWC may make the order only if a person has applied for it under subsection (4).  Chapter 3  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The FWC may make an order varying the proportion by which an employee’s payments are reduced. (2) The FWC may make the order only if a person has applied for it under subsection (4).  Chapter 3  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc."@en ;
