concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-475 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "475 Accepting or seeking payments relating to periods of industrial"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-475 ;
    values:originalText "action (1) An employee must not: (a) accept a payment from an employer if the employer would contravene section 474 by making the payment; or (b) ask the employer to make such a payment. Note 1: This subsection is a civil remedy provision (see Part 4-1). Note 2: Acts of coercion, or misrepresentations, relating to such payments may also contravene section 348 or 349. (2) An employee organisation, or an officer or member of an employee organisation, must not ask an employer to make a payment to an employee if the employer would contravene section 474 by making the payment.  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc.  Chapter 3 Industrial action  Part 3-3 Payments relating to periods of industrial action  Division 9 Section 476 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 Note 1: This subsection is a civil remedy provision (see Part 4-1). Note 2: Acts of coercion, or misrepresentations, relating to such payments may also contravene section 348 or 349. Subdivision C—Miscellaneous" ;
    skos:definition "action (1) An employee must not: (a) accept a payment from an employer if the employer would contravene section 474 by making the payment; or (b) ask the employer to make such a payment. Note 1: This subsection is a civil remedy provision (see Part 4-1). Note 2: Acts of coercion, or misrepresentations, relating to such payments may also contravene section 348 or 349. (2) An employee organisation, or an officer or member of an employee organisation, must not ask an employer to make a payment to an employee if the employer would contravene section 474 by making the payment.  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc.  Chapter 3 Industrial action  Part 3-3 Payments relating to periods of industrial action  Division 9 Section 476 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 Note 1: This subsection is a civil remedy provision (see Part 4-1). Note 2: Acts of coercion, or misrepresentations, relating to such payments may also contravene section 348 or 349. Subdivision C—Miscellaneous"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "bd938c688f49b77c7fc537c6b9222e2c97ebddd63076b87f2feaec66fb9c05d0" ;
    cof:pageNumber "272"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-475-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-475-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
