doc:sec-475-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "475(1) Accepting or seeking payments relating to periods of industrial" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) An employee must not: (a) accept a payment from an employer if the employer would contravene section 474 by making the payment; or (b) ask the employer to make such a payment. Note 1: This subsection is a civil remedy provision (see Part 4-1). Note 2: Acts of coercion, or misrepresentations, relating to such payments may also contravene section 348 or 349." ;
    cof:pageNumber "272"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-475-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "475(2) Accepting or seeking payments relating to periods of industrial"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-475-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) An employee organisation, or an officer or member of an employee organisation, must not ask an employer to make a payment to an employee if the employer would contravene section 474 by making the payment.  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc.  Chapter 3 Industrial action  Part 3-3 Payments relating to periods of industrial action  Division 9 Section 476 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 Note 1: This subsection is a civil remedy provision (see Part 4-1). Note 2: Acts of coercion, or misrepresentations, relating to such payments may also contravene section 348 or 349. Subdivision C—Miscellaneous" ;
    skos:definition "(2) An employee organisation, or an officer or member of an employee organisation, must not ask an employer to make a payment to an employee if the employer would contravene section 474 by making the payment.  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc.  Chapter 3 Industrial action  Part 3-3 Payments relating to periods of industrial action  Division 9 Section 476 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 Note 1: This subsection is a civil remedy provision (see Part 4-1). Note 2: Acts of coercion, or misrepresentations, relating to such payments may also contravene section 348 or 349. Subdivision C—Miscellaneous"@en ;
