concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-476 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "476 Other responses to industrial action unaffected"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-476 ;
    values:originalText "If an employee engaged, or engages, in industrial action against an employer, this Division does not affect any right of the employer, under this Act or otherwise, to do anything in response to the industrial action that does not involve payments to the employee.  Chapter 3  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc." ;
    skos:definition "If an employee engaged, or engages, in industrial action against an employer, this Division does not affect any right of the employer, under this Act or otherwise, to do anything in response to the industrial action that does not involve payments to the employee.  Chapter 3  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc."@en ;
