doc:sec-483-ss-1a a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "483(1A) Later access to record or document" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1A) However, an affected employer is not required under subsection (1) to produce, or provide access to, a record or document if to do so would contravene a law of the Commonwealth or a law of a State or Territory.  Chapter 3  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc." ;
