doc:sec-483c-ss-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "483C(5) Later access to record or document" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) An occupier or affected employer must not contravene a requirement under subsection (1). Note: This subsection is a civil remedy provision (see Part 4-1). Where record or document may be inspected or copied" ;
