concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-483c-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "483C(6) Later access to record or document"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-483c-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) The permit holder may inspect, and make copies of, the record or document at: (a) the premises; or (b) if another place is agreed upon by the permit holder and the occupier or affected employer—that other place. Note 1: The use or disclosure of information or documents obtained under this section is strictly controlled (see section 504). Note 2: The use or disclosure of personal information obtained under this section is regulated under the Privacy Act 1988." ;
    skos:definition "(6) The permit holder may inspect, and make copies of, the record or document at: (a) the premises; or (b) if another place is agreed upon by the permit holder and the occupier or affected employer—that other place. Note 1: The use or disclosure of information or documents obtained under this section is strictly controlled (see section 504). Note 2: The use or disclosure of personal information obtained under this section is regulated under the Privacy Act 1988."@en ;
