concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-496 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "496 Contravening entry permit conditions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-496 ;
    values:originalText "In exercising a State or Territory OHS right, a permit holder must not contravene a condition imposed on his or her entry permit. Note: This section is a civil remedy provision (see Part 4-1)." ;
    skos:definition "In exercising a State or Territory OHS right, a permit holder must not contravene a condition imposed on his or her entry permit. Note: This section is a civil remedy provision (see Part 4-1)."@en ;
