doc:sec-505a-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "505A(2) FWC may deal with a dispute about frequency of entry to hold" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The FWC may deal with a dispute about the frequency with which a permit holder or permit holders of an organisation enter premises under section 484." ;
    cof:pageNumber "301"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-505a-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "505A(3) FWC may deal with a dispute about frequency of entry to hold"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-505a-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The FWC may deal with the dispute by arbitration, including by making one or more of the following orders: (a) an order imposing conditions on an entry permit; (b) an order suspending an entry permit; (c) an order revoking an entry permit; (d) an order about the future issue of entry permits to one or more persons; (e) any other order it considers appropriate. Note: The FWC may also deal with a dispute by mediation or conciliation, or by making a recommendation or expressing an opinion (see subsection 595(2))." ;
    skos:definition "(3) The FWC may deal with the dispute by arbitration, including by making one or more of the following orders: (a) an order imposing conditions on an entry permit; (b) an order suspending an entry permit; (c) an order revoking an entry permit; (d) an order about the future issue of entry permits to one or more persons; (e) any other order it considers appropriate. Note: The FWC may also deal with a dispute by mediation or conciliation, or by making a recommendation or expressing an opinion (see subsection 595(2))."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "dec2d963cbb61f6fe0db80de874c2becfeba50c68f48578089de5b3f151c392a" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-505a ;
