concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-506 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "506 Contravening order made to deal with dispute"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-506 ;
    values:originalText "A person must not contravene a term of an order under subsection 505(2) or subsection 505A(3). Note: This section is a civil remedy provision (see Part 4-1). Subdivision B—Taking action against permit holder" ;
    skos:definition "A person must not contravene a term of an order under subsection 505(2) or subsection 505A(3). Note: This section is a civil remedy provision (see Part 4-1). Subdivision B—Taking action against permit holder"@en ;
