    skos:prefLabel "515(4) Conditions on entry permit"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-515-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) If the FWC imposes a condition on an entry permit after it has been issued, the permit ceases to be in force until the FWC records the condition on the permit." ;
