doc:sec-518-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "518(1) Entry notice requirements" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) An entry notice must specify the following: (a) the premises that are proposed to be entered; (b) the day of the entry; (c) the organisation of which the permit holder for the entry is an official.  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc.  Chapter 3 Right of entry  Part 3-4 Entry permits, entry notices and certificates  Division 6 Section 518 Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 Requirements for entry notice for entry to investigate suspected contravention" ;
