doc:sec-520-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "520(1) Affected member certificates" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The FWC must, on application by an organisation, issue a certificate (an affected member certificate) to the organisation if the FWC is satisfied that: (a) a member of the organisation performs work on particular premises; and (b) the organisation is entitled to represent the industrial interests of the member; and (c) a suspected contravention of a kind referred to in subsection 481(1) relates to, or affects, the member." ;
    cof:pageNumber "313"^^xsd:integer .

