    skos:definition "(2) If all of the following are satisfied: (a) to provide transport to the premises for the permit holder, or cause that transport to be provided, would not cause the occupier undue inconvenience; (b) the permit holder, or the organisation of which the permit holder is an official, requests the occupier to provide, or cause to be provided, transport to the premises for the  Chapter 3  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc."@en ;
