doc:sec-527e-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "527E(3) Vicarious liability etc." ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) Subsections (1) and (2A) do not limit section 550 or 793.  Chapter 3  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc." ;
