concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-527f-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "527F(4) Application for the FWC to deal with a sexual harassment"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-527f-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) Without limiting section 609, the procedural rules may provide for the following: (a) the making of applications under subsection (1) by: (i) 2 or more persons of the kind referred to in subsection (2) acting jointly; or (ii) a single industrial association that is entitled to represent the industrial interests of 2 or more aggrieved persons; being applications made in relation to the same alleged contravention, or related alleged contraventions, of" ;
    skos:definition "(4) Without limiting section 609, the procedural rules may provide for the following: (a) the making of applications under subsection (1) by: (i) 2 or more persons of the kind referred to in subsection (2) acting jointly; or (ii) a single industrial association that is entitled to represent the industrial interests of 2 or more aggrieved persons; being applications made in relation to the same alleged contravention, or related alleged contraventions, of"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c1e48d08849d1bae0f6d1fc474637837ee1ae75390a5c9c694e11b589f4bb714" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-527f ;
    cof:pageNumber "328"^^xsd:integer ;
