    skos:prefLabel "527R(2) Dealing with a sexual harassment dispute (other than by"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-527r-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) Any conference conducted for the purposes of dealing with the dispute (other than by arbitration) must be conducted in private, despite subsection 592(3). Note: For conferences, see section 592." ;
    skos:definition "(2) Any conference conducted for the purposes of dealing with the dispute (other than by arbitration) must be conducted in private, despite subsection 592(3). Note: For conferences, see section 592."@en ;
