doc:sec-527r-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "527R(2) Dealing with a sexual harassment dispute (other than by" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) Any conference conducted for the purposes of dealing with the dispute (other than by arbitration) must be conducted in private, despite subsection 592(3). Note: For conferences, see section 592." ;
    cof:pageNumber "334"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-527r-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "527R(3) Dealing with a sexual harassment dispute (other than by"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-527r-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) If the FWC is satisfied that all reasonable attempts to resolve the dispute (other than by arbitration) have been, or are likely to be, unsuccessful, then: (a) the FWC must issue a certificate to that effect; and (b) if the FWC considers, taking into account all the materials before it, that arbitration under section 527S, or a sexual harassment court application, in relation to the dispute would not have a reasonable prospect of success, the FWC must advise the parties accordingly." ;
    skos:definition "(3) If the FWC is satisfied that all reasonable attempts to resolve the dispute (other than by arbitration) have been, or are likely to be, unsuccessful, then: (a) the FWC must issue a certificate to that effect; and (b) if the FWC considers, taking into account all the materials before it, that arbitration under section 527S, or a sexual harassment court application, in relation to the dispute would not have a reasonable prospect of success, the FWC must advise the parties accordingly."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8c034da412067c86942f84ebd1e36982c41ce6933b2ce53f107bf175ff541966" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-527r ;
    cof:pageNumber "334"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "FWC must issue certificate if dispute resolution attempts are unsuccessful" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <fair-work-act-2009.pdf> ;
    dc:source "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.334" ;
