doc:sec-534 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "534 Limits on scope of this Division" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1) This Division does not apply in relation to any of the following employees: (a) an employee employed for a specified period of time, for a specified task, or for the duration of a specified season; (b) an employee who is dismissed because of serious misconduct; (c) a casual employee; (d) an employee (other than an apprentice) to whom a training arrangement applies and whose employment is for a specified period of time or is, for any reason, limited to the duration of the training arrangement; (e) a daily hire employee working in the building and construction industry (including working in connection with  Chapter 3  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc." ;
