concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536e a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "536E Meaning of registered organisations officer or employee"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-536e ;
    values:originalText "Each of the following is a registered organisations officer or employee: (a) an officer (within the meaning of the Registered Organisations Act) of an organisation or branch of an organisation;  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc.  Chapter 3 Corrupting benefits  Part 3-7 Giving, receiving or soliciting corrupting benefits  Division 2 Section 536E Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 (b) an employee of an organisation or branch of an organisation.  Chapter 3  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc." ;
    skos:definition "Each of the following is a registered organisations officer or employee: (a) an officer (within the meaning of the Registered Organisations Act) of an organisation or branch of an organisation;  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc.  Chapter 3 Corrupting benefits  Part 3-7 Giving, receiving or soliciting corrupting benefits  Division 2 Section 536E Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 (b) an employee of an organisation or branch of an organisation.  Chapter 3  Rights and responsibilities of employees, employers, organisations etc."@en ;
