concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536h a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "536H Implied freedom of political communication"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-536h ;
    values:originalText "(1) This Division does not apply to the extent (if any) that it would infringe any constitutional doctrine of implied freedom of political communication. (2) Subsection (1) does not limit the application of section 15A of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901.  Chapter 3A  Minimum standards for regulated workers" ;
    skos:definition "(1) This Division does not apply to the extent (if any) that it would infringe any constitutional doctrine of implied freedom of political communication. (2) Subsection (1) does not limit the application of section 15A of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901.  Chapter 3A  Minimum standards for regulated workers"@en ;
