doc:sec-536jb a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "536JB Contravening a minimum standards order" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "A person must not contravene a term of a minimum standards order. Note 1: This section is a civil remedy provision (see Part 4-1). Note 2: A person does not contravene a term of a minimum standards order unless the order applies to the person: see subsection 536JC(1)." ;
    cof:pageNumber "359"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536jc a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "536JC The significance of a minimum standards order applying to a"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-536jc ;
    values:originalText "person (1) A minimum standards order does not impose obligations on a person, and a person does not contravene a term of a minimum standards order, unless the order applies to the person. (2) A minimum standards order does not give a person an entitlement unless the order applies to the person. 536JD  When a minimum standards order applies to a person When a minimum standards order applies to a regulated worker (1) A minimum standards order applies to a regulated worker if: (a) the minimum standards order covers the regulated worker; and (b) the minimum standards order is in operation; and  Chapter 3A  Minimum standards for regulated workers" ;
    skos:definition "person (1) A minimum standards order does not impose obligations on a person, and a person does not contravene a term of a minimum standards order, unless the order applies to the person. (2) A minimum standards order does not give a person an entitlement unless the order applies to the person. 536JD  When a minimum standards order applies to a person When a minimum standards order applies to a regulated worker (1) A minimum standards order applies to a regulated worker if: (a) the minimum standards order covers the regulated worker; and (b) the minimum standards order is in operation; and  Chapter 3A  Minimum standards for regulated workers"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "38a81e87e79631e602bf5fbd307ce2fcd382b1670c585ea09032aac778a80531" ;
    cof:pageNumber "359"^^xsd:integer ;
