    values:originalText "person (1) A minimum standards order does not impose obligations on a person, and a person does not contravene a term of a minimum standards order, unless the order applies to the person. (2) A minimum standards order does not give a person an entitlement unless the order applies to the person. 536JD  When a minimum standards order applies to a person When a minimum standards order applies to a regulated worker (1) A minimum standards order applies to a regulated worker if: (a) the minimum standards order covers the regulated worker; and (b) the minimum standards order is in operation; and  Chapter 3A  Minimum standards for regulated workers" ;
    cof:pageNumber "359"^^xsd:integer .

