concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536jj a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "536JJ Contravening a collective agreement"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-536jj ;
    values:originalText "A person must not contravene a term of a collective agreement. Note 1: This section is a civil remedy provision (see Part 4-1). Note 2: A person does not contravene a term of a collective agreement unless the agreement applies to the person: see section 536JK." ;
    skos:definition "A person must not contravene a term of a collective agreement. Note 1: This section is a civil remedy provision (see Part 4-1). Note 2: A person does not contravene a term of a collective agreement unless the agreement applies to the person: see section 536JK."@en ;
