concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536jk-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "536JK(2) The significance of a collective agreement applying to a"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-536jk-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) A collective agreement does not give a person an entitlement unless the agreement applies to the person. 536JL  When a collective agreement applies to a person When a collective agreement applies to a regulated worker" ;
    skos:definition "(2) A collective agreement does not give a person an entitlement unless the agreement applies to the person. 536JL  When a collective agreement applies to a person When a collective agreement applies to a regulated worker"@en ;
