doc:sec-536jt-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "536JT(3) Authorisation of conduct for the purposes of the Competition" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) For the purposes of subsection 51(1) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010, and the Competition Code within the meaning of that Act, anything done by a person or entity in preparation for, or incidental to, making, or applying for registration of, a collective agreement is specified in and specifically authorised by this Act. Certain conduct not protected" ;
