concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536jv a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "536JV Guide to this Part"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-536jv ;
    values:originalText "This Part is about setting minimum standards for certain regulated workers, specifically, employee-like workers and regulated road transport contractors. Division 2 of this Part sets out the minimum standards objective to which the FWC must have regard when performing a function or exercising a power under this Part. Division 3 empowers the FWC to make minimum standards orders for regulated workers, which set minimum standards to which they are entitled in relation to certain matters including payment terms and working time. Division 4 empowers the FWC to make minimum standards guidelines for regulated workers. Division 5 provides for regulations to be made in relation to internal review of certain decisions." ;
    skos:definition "This Part is about setting minimum standards for certain regulated workers, specifically, employee-like workers and regulated road transport contractors. Division 2 of this Part sets out the minimum standards objective to which the FWC must have regard when performing a function or exercising a power under this Part. Division 3 empowers the FWC to make minimum standards orders for regulated workers, which set minimum standards to which they are entitled in relation to certain matters including payment terms and working time. Division 4 empowers the FWC to make minimum standards guidelines for regulated workers. Division 5 provides for regulations to be made in relation to internal review of certain decisions."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "2d48860d8d2a09102461a18f8d929a1ff7fab9b21c02f93833f877314974acf9" ;
    cof:pageNumber "376"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Sets minimum standards for regulated workers" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
