concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536jw a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "536JW Meaning of employee and employer"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-536jw ;
    values:originalText "In this Part, employee and employer have their ordinary meanings.  Minimum standards for regulated workers  Chapter 3A Minimum standards for regulated workers  Part 3A-2 The minimum standards objective  Division 2 Section 536JX Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
    skos:definition "In this Part, employee and employer have their ordinary meanings.  Minimum standards for regulated workers  Chapter 3A Minimum standards for regulated workers  Part 3A-2 The minimum standards objective  Division 2 Section 536JX Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026"@en ;
