doc:sec-536k-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "536K(2) Particular matters FWC must take into account in making a" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) Before making a decision to which this section applies, the FWC must consider whether, on the whole, the persons included (or purportedly included) in the class of employee-like workers to be  Minimum standards for regulated workers  Chapter 3A Minimum standards for regulated workers  Part 3A-2 Minimum standards orders  Division 3 Section 536KAA Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 covered by the order, or the order as proposed to be varied, are employee-like workers." ;
    cof:pageNumber "380"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536k-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "536K(3) Particular matters FWC must take into account in making a"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-536k-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) If the FWC is not satisfied that, on the whole, the persons included (or purportedly included) in the class of employee-like workers to be covered by the minimum standards order, or the order as proposed to be varied, are employee-like workers, the FWC must decide to refuse to consider the application, or not to make or vary the order, as the case requires." ;
    skos:definition "(3) If the FWC is not satisfied that, on the whole, the persons included (or purportedly included) in the class of employee-like workers to be covered by the minimum standards order, or the order as proposed to be varied, are employee-like workers, the FWC must decide to refuse to consider the application, or not to make or vary the order, as the case requires."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9a1b20acf302ac0d122e18c8eea9303dfd55d75451db07ff002804184e15bae0" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536k ;
    cof:pageNumber "380"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "FWC must decide to refuse to consider an application if not satisfied about employee-like workers." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
