concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536k-ss-1 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "536K(1) Particular matters FWC must take into account in making a"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-536k-ss-1 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Before making an employee-like worker minimum standards order, the FWC must: (a) publish a notice (a notice of intent) stating that the FWC proposes to make an employee-like worker minimum standards order; and (b) publish a draft of the proposed employee-like worker minimum standards order." ;
    skos:definition "(1) Before making an employee-like worker minimum standards order, the FWC must: (a) publish a notice (a notice of intent) stating that the FWC proposes to make an employee-like worker minimum standards order; and (b) publish a draft of the proposed employee-like worker minimum standards order."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ad0e6a9a975546100373003434f77a66b315c51a126eac15dff766d1eefcf605" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536k ;
    cof:pageNumber "380"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Publish notice of intent and draft proposed order before making employee-like worker minimum standards order. FWC must take into account certain matters when making a decision on employee-like worker minimum standards orders." ;
    dc:description "Notice of intent, draft order" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
