    skos:prefLabel "536KA(2) Particular matters FWC must take into account in making a"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-536ka-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The FWC: (a) must not make or vary the road transport minimum standards order unless there has been genuine engagement with the parties to be covered; and (b) must not make or vary the road transport minimum standards order unless the Road Transport Advisory Group has been consulted; and (c) must not make or vary the road transport minimum standards order unless the consultation process set out in Subdivision D has been followed; and (d) must have regard to the commercial realities of the road transport industry; and (e) must be satisfied that making or varying the road transport minimum standards order will not unduly affect the viability and competitiveness of owner drivers or other similar persons.  Minimum standards for regulated workers  Chapter 3A Minimum standards for regulated workers  Part 3A-2 Minimum standards orders  Division 3 Section 536KB Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 Subdivision D—Consultation process for road transport minimum standards orders" ;
    skos:definition "(2) The FWC: (a) must not make or vary the road transport minimum standards order unless there has been genuine engagement with the parties to be covered; and (b) must not make or vary the road transport minimum standards order unless the Road Transport Advisory Group has been consulted; and (c) must not make or vary the road transport minimum standards order unless the consultation process set out in Subdivision D has been followed; and (d) must have regard to the commercial realities of the road transport industry; and (e) must be satisfied that making or varying the road transport minimum standards order will not unduly affect the viability and competitiveness of owner drivers or other similar persons.  Minimum standards for regulated workers  Chapter 3A Minimum standards for regulated workers  Part 3A-2 Minimum standards orders  Division 3 Section 536KB Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 Subdivision D—Consultation process for road transport minimum standards orders"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "5da3ca67a13fdde5ff8a859683bc55235731b8df928e8925c0ec53c35a436098" ;
    values:partOf concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536ka ;
