concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536kf a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "536KF Decision not to make order based on the draft"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-536kf ;
    values:originalText "The FWC may decide that no road transport minimum standards order is to be made based on the draft. If the FWC does so, the FWC must publish notice of the decision on its website and by any other means the FWC considers appropriate. Subdivision E—Decisions on minimum standards orders" ;
    skos:definition "The FWC may decide that no road transport minimum standards order is to be made based on the draft. If the FWC does so, the FWC must publish notice of the decision on its website and by any other means the FWC considers appropriate. Subdivision E—Decisions on minimum standards orders"@en ;
