    skos:prefLabel "536KJ(2) Terms that must be included in a road transport minimum"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-536kj-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) A road transport minimum standards order must be expressed to cover: (a) specified road transport businesses; and (b) specified regulated road transport contractors." ;
