concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536km-ss-1 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "536KM(1) Terms that must not be included in a minimum standards"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-536km-ss-1 ;
    values:originalText "(1) In addition to the matters in section 536KM, an employee-like worker minimum standards order must not include terms about any of the following matters: (a) penalty rates for work performed at particular times or on particular days (including, but not limited to, loadings and shift allowances); (b) payment for: (i) time before the acceptance of an engagement on a digital labour platform; or (ii) time in between the completion of an engagement and the commencement of the next engagement on a digital labour platform; (c) minimum periods of engagement or a minimum payment referable to a period of minimum engagement.  Chapter 3A  Minimum standards for regulated workers" ;
    skos:definition "(1) In addition to the matters in section 536KM, an employee-like worker minimum standards order must not include terms about any of the following matters: (a) penalty rates for work performed at particular times or on particular days (including, but not limited to, loadings and shift allowances); (b) payment for: (i) time before the acceptance of an engagement on a digital labour platform; or (ii) time in between the completion of an engagement and the commencement of the next engagement on a digital labour platform; (c) minimum periods of engagement or a minimum payment referable to a period of minimum engagement.  Chapter 3A  Minimum standards for regulated workers"@en ;
