concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536kv a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "536KV Minimum standards guidelines not to be made if a minimum"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-536kv ;
    values:originalText "standards order is in operation The FWC must not make minimum standards guidelines that cover the same regulated workers and the same regulated businesses in relation to the same matters as a minimum standards order that is in operation." ;
    skos:definition "standards order is in operation The FWC must not make minimum standards guidelines that cover the same regulated workers and the same regulated businesses in relation to the same matters as a minimum standards order that is in operation."@en ;
