concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536ky a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "536KY Terms that must not be included in minimum standards"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-536ky ;
    values:originalText "guidelines Minimum standards guidelines must not include terms about any of the matters that must not be included in minimum standards orders as set out in the following: (a) in the case of employee-like worker minimum standards orders and road transport minimum standards orders—in section 536KM; (aa) in the case of employee-like worker minimum standards orders—in section 536KMA; (b) in the case of road transport minimum standards orders—in section 536KN." ;
    skos:definition "guidelines Minimum standards guidelines must not include terms about any of the matters that must not be included in minimum standards orders as set out in the following: (a) in the case of employee-like worker minimum standards orders and road transport minimum standards orders—in section 536KM; (aa) in the case of employee-like worker minimum standards orders—in section 536KMA; (b) in the case of road transport minimum standards orders—in section 536KN."@en ;
