doc:sec-536ll a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "536LL Meaning of terminated" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "A person has been terminated if: (a) the person performed work as a regulated road transport contractor under a services contract; and (b) a road transport business received services under the services contract; and (c) the services contract was terminated by, or as a result of conduct of, the road transport business.  Minimum standards for regulated workers  Chapter 3A Unfair deactivation or unfair termination of regulated workers  Part 3A-3 What is an unfair deactivation or unfair termination  Division 3 Section 536LM Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
    cof:pageNumber "430"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536lm a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "536LM Criteria for considering whether a termination was unfair"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-536lm ;
    values:originalText "etc. (1) In considering whether it is satisfied that a termination was unfair, the FWC must take into account: (a) whether there was a valid reason for the termination related to the person’s capacity or conduct; and (b) whether any relevant processes specified in the Road Transport Industry Termination Code were followed; and (c) any other matters that the FWC considers relevant. (2) Despite subsection (1) and any other provision of this Part, a termination that occurs because of serious misconduct of the person who was deactivated is not unfair." ;
    skos:definition "etc. (1) In considering whether it is satisfied that a termination was unfair, the FWC must take into account: (a) whether there was a valid reason for the termination related to the person’s capacity or conduct; and (b) whether any relevant processes specified in the Road Transport Industry Termination Code were followed; and (c) any other matters that the FWC considers relevant. (2) Despite subsection (1) and any other provision of this Part, a termination that occurs because of serious misconduct of the person who was deactivated is not unfair."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "41b387a9617d9ffde9dc713bb94531bfc48d834db2fdc78d61c2040332d7bd35" ;
    cof:pageNumber "431"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536lm-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536lm-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <fair-work-act-2009.pdf> ;
    dc:source "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.431" .
doc:sec-536lm a cof:Section ;
