    values:originalText "(2) If: (a) the road transport business at the time of the termination is no longer a road transport business; and (b) an associated entity of the road transport business is a road transport business;  Chapter 3A  Minimum standards for regulated workers" ;
    skos:definition "(2) If: (a) the road transport business at the time of the termination is no longer a road transport business; and (b) an associated entity of the road transport business is a road transport business;  Chapter 3A  Minimum standards for regulated workers"@en ;
