    values:originalText "(1) An order for the payment of compensation to a person must be an order that the road transport business at the time of the termination pay compensation to the person in lieu of entering into a new services contract.  Minimum standards for regulated workers  Chapter 3A Unfair deactivation or unfair termination of regulated workers  Part 3A-3 Remedies  Division 4 Section 536LT Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 Criteria for deciding amounts" ;
