concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536lv a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "536LV Application fees"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-536lv ;
    values:originalText "(1) An application to the FWC under this Division must be accompanied by any fee prescribed by the regulations. (2) The regulations may prescribe: (a) a fee for making an application to the FWC under this Division; and (b) a method for indexing the fee; and (c) the circumstances in which all or part of the fee may be waived or refunded." ;
    skos:definition "(1) An application to the FWC under this Division must be accompanied by any fee prescribed by the regulations. (2) The regulations may prescribe: (a) a fee for making an application to the FWC under this Division; and (b) a method for indexing the fee; and (c) the circumstances in which all or part of the fee may be waived or refunded."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "bbec1db1c28258da354dfc2b91ca14fa58302ad596b9137b7273295d93ee9f0f" ;
    cof:pageNumber "440"^^xsd:integer ;
