    cof:title "536LV Application fees" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1) An application to the FWC under this Division must be accompanied by any fee prescribed by the regulations. (2) The regulations may prescribe: (a) a fee for making an application to the FWC under this Division; and (b) a method for indexing the fee; and (c) the circumstances in which all or part of the fee may be waived or refunded." ;
    cof:pageNumber "440"^^xsd:integer .

