doc:sec-536lx a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "536LX Matters involving contested facts" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "The FWC must conduct a conference or hold a hearing in relation to a matter arising under this Part if, and to the extent that, the matter involves facts the existence of which is in dispute.  Minimum standards for regulated workers  Chapter 3A Unfair deactivation or unfair termination of regulated workers  Part 3A-3 Procedural matters  Division 5 Section 536LY Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
    cof:pageNumber "440"^^xsd:integer .

concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536ly a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "536LY Conferences"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-536ly ;
    values:originalText "(1) This section applies in relation to a matter arising under this Part if the FWC conducts a conference in relation to the matter. (2) Despite subsection 592(3), the FWC must conduct the conference in private. (3) The FWC must take into account any difference in the circumstances of the parties to the matter in: (a) considering the application; and (b) informing itself in relation to the application. (4) The FWC must take into account the wishes of the parties to the matter as to the way in which the FWC: (a) considers the application; and (b) informs itself in relation to the application." ;
    skos:definition "(1) This section applies in relation to a matter arising under this Part if the FWC conducts a conference in relation to the matter. (2) Despite subsection 592(3), the FWC must conduct the conference in private. (3) The FWC must take into account any difference in the circumstances of the parties to the matter in: (a) considering the application; and (b) informing itself in relation to the application. (4) The FWC must take into account the wishes of the parties to the matter as to the way in which the FWC: (a) considers the application; and (b) informs itself in relation to the application."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9c86a4507aa7f2bdff7d949b0811e222e431bc325aba0201ec3a816e94fec0aa" ;
    cof:pageNumber "441"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536ly-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536ly-ss-2 ;
