    skos:prefLabel "536ML(2) Notice of consultation period for a proposed collective"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-536ml-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) A consultation notice for a proposed collective agreement must specify the following: (a) that the entity giving the notice (the notifying entity) proposes to try to make a collective agreement under this Part; (b) whichever of the following is applicable: (i) if the notifying entity is a regulated business—the name of the organisation to which the consultation notice is given;  Minimum standards for regulated workers  Chapter 3A Collective agreements for regulated workers  Part 3A-4 Regulated workers and regulated businesses may make collective agreements  Division Section 536MM Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 (ii) otherwise—the name of the organisation giving the consultation notice; (c) the matters that are to be dealt with by the proposed collective agreement; (d) the regulated business that will be covered by the proposed collective agreement; (e) the class of regulated workers who will be covered by the proposed collective agreement. 536MM  Consultation notice to be given to FWC, etc." ;
    skos:definition "(2) A consultation notice for a proposed collective agreement must specify the following: (a) that the entity giving the notice (the notifying entity) proposes to try to make a collective agreement under this Part; (b) whichever of the following is applicable: (i) if the notifying entity is a regulated business—the name of the organisation to which the consultation notice is given;  Minimum standards for regulated workers  Chapter 3A Collective agreements for regulated workers  Part 3A-4 Regulated workers and regulated businesses may make collective agreements  Division Section 536MM Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026 (ii) otherwise—the name of the organisation giving the consultation notice; (c) the matters that are to be dealt with by the proposed collective agreement; (d) the regulated business that will be covered by the proposed collective agreement; (e) the class of regulated workers who will be covered by the proposed collective agreement. 536MM  Consultation notice to be given to FWC, etc."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8d10f684ed0487aa9bd513651b453afd0adcbe3ecaf6647d7d58904842dfd1d6" ;
