concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536mx a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "536MX Terms of a collective agreement that are of no effect"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-536mx ;
    values:originalText "(1) A term of a collective agreement has no effect to the extent that it is a term about a matter other than a matter mentioned in subsection 536MK(2) or (3). (2) A term of a collective agreement has no effect to the extent that it deals with matters that are primarily of a commercial nature that do not affect the terms and conditions of engagement of regulated workers covered by the agreement. (3) However, if a collective agreement includes a term that has no effect because of subsection (1) or (2), the inclusion of the term does not prevent the agreement from being a collective agreement.  Minimum standards for regulated workers  Chapter 3A Unfair contract terms of services contracts  Part 3A-5 Introduction  Division 1 Section 536MY Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(1) A term of a collective agreement has no effect to the extent that it is a term about a matter other than a matter mentioned in subsection 536MK(2) or (3). (2) A term of a collective agreement has no effect to the extent that it deals with matters that are primarily of a commercial nature that do not affect the terms and conditions of engagement of regulated workers covered by the agreement. (3) However, if a collective agreement includes a term that has no effect because of subsection (1) or (2), the inclusion of the term does not prevent the agreement from being a collective agreement.  Minimum standards for regulated workers  Chapter 3A Unfair contract terms of services contracts  Part 3A-5 Introduction  Division 1 Section 536MY Fair Work Act 2009 Compilation date: 02/04/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "adbf64d15472e229c4bbe0a2be0fe0b1378bcb554d086addf0ced8c7755ef67c" ;
    cof:pageNumber "458"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536mx-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536mx-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536mx-ss-3 ;
