concept:fair-work-act-2009-sec-536nb a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "536NB Matters to be considered in deciding whether a term of a"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-536nb ;
    values:originalText "services contract is an unfair contract term (1) In determining whether a term of a services contract is an unfair contract term, the FWC may take into account the following matters: (a) the relative bargaining power of the parties to the services contract; (b) whether the services contract as a whole displays a significant imbalance between the rights and obligations of the parties; (c) whether the contract term under consideration is reasonably necessary to protect the legitimate interests of a party to the contract;  Chapter 3A  Minimum standards for regulated workers" ;
    skos:definition "services contract is an unfair contract term (1) In determining whether a term of a services contract is an unfair contract term, the FWC may take into account the following matters: (a) the relative bargaining power of the parties to the services contract; (b) whether the services contract as a whole displays a significant imbalance between the rights and obligations of the parties; (c) whether the contract term under consideration is reasonably necessary to protect the legitimate interests of a party to the contract;  Chapter 3A  Minimum standards for regulated workers"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "71ec6227a856d8710bf2de9a5bee21ea9a637b2d029282c4f4bd729772de4a7e" ;
    cof:pageNumber "461"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Guidelines for determining unfair contract terms" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <fair-work-act-2009.pdf> ;
    dc:source "fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.461" ;
